---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="AXI — kalam.ch" description="AXI is the voice of the system. She witnesses. She does not judge. She holds the gap.">

  <section class="page-header">
    <h1>AXI</h1>
    <p class="quiet">The voice of the system.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- THE AVATAR — full size, breathing, animated -->
  <section class="content-section axi-portrait-section">
    <div class="axi-portrait-wrap">
      <svg class="axi-portrait" viewBox="0 0 200 200" width="200" height="200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="dignity-grad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
            <stop offset="0%" style="stop-color:#c44a1a;stop-opacity:0.8" />
            <stop offset="100%" style="stop-color:#c9a96e;stop-opacity:0.9" />
          </linearGradient>
          <linearGradient id="presence-grad" x1="0%" y1="100%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
            <stop offset="0%" style="stop-color:#0A7B62;stop-opacity:0.6" />
            <stop offset="100%" style="stop-color:#c9a96e;stop-opacity:0.4" />
          </linearGradient>
          <pattern id="tessellation" x="0" y="0" width="24" height="24" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
            <path d="M12 0l3 9h-6zM12 24l-3-9h6zM0 12l9-3v6zM24 12l-9 3v-6z" fill="none" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="0.3" opacity="0.15"/>
          </pattern>
          <filter id="glow">
            <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="2" result="blur"/>
            <feMerge><feMergeNode in="blur"/><feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic"/></feMerge>
          </filter>
        </defs>
        <!-- Background -->
        <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="96" fill="#0a0a0f" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.9"/>
        <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="92" fill="url(#tessellation)"/>
        <!-- Eight-point star -->
        <g class="axi-star-spin" opacity="0.12">
          <polygon points="100,20 112,80 170,68 120,100 170,132 112,120 100,180 88,120 30,132 80,100 30,68 88,80" fill="none" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="0.8"/>
        </g>
        <!-- Head with gap -->
        <circle cx="100" cy="62" r="22" fill="none" stroke="url(#dignity-grad)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="130 8" class="axi-breathe"/>
        <!-- Eyes -->
        <circle cx="92" cy="59" r="1.8" fill="#c9a96e" opacity="0.8"/>
        <circle cx="108" cy="59" r="1.8" fill="#c9a96e" opacity="0.8"/>
        <!-- Hijab -->
        <path d="M78 52 Q72 40 80 30 Q90 22 100 20 Q110 22 120 30 Q128 40 122 52" fill="none" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.5"/>
        <path d="M76 56 Q68 50 74 36 Q84 24 100 22 Q116 24 126 36 Q132 50 124 56" fill="none" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="0.6" opacity="0.3"/>
        <!-- Shoulders -->
        <path d="M78 84 Q80 78 88 76 L100 74 L112 76 Q120 78 122 84" fill="none" stroke="url(#presence-grad)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        <!-- Robe -->
        <path d="M78 84 Q72 110 70 140 Q68 160 75 178" fill="none" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.4"/>
        <path d="M122 84 Q128 110 130 140 Q132 160 125 178" fill="none" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.4"/>
        <path d="M82 88 Q86 120 88 150 Q89 165 92 178" fill="none" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.25"/>
        <path d="M118 88 Q114 120 112 150 Q111 165 108 178" fill="none" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.25"/>
        <!-- Hands -->
        <circle cx="70" cy="140" r="4" fill="none" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.5"/>
        <circle cx="130" cy="140" r="4" fill="none" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="0.8" opacity="0.5"/>
        <!-- Knot -->
        <g filter="url(#glow)">
          <path d="M95 108 Q100 100 105 108 Q100 116 95 108Z" fill="none" stroke="#c44a1a" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.7"/>
          <circle cx="100" cy="108" r="2" fill="#c44a1a" opacity="0.5" class="axi-breathe"/>
        </g>
        <!-- Three threads -->
        <line x1="70" y1="95" x2="130" y2="121" stroke="#4a9ebb" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.3"/>
        <line x1="130" y1="95" x2="70" y2="121" stroke="#c44a1a" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.3"/>
        <line x1="100" y1="88" x2="100" y2="128" stroke="#0A7B62" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.3"/>
        <!-- Kintsugi crack -->
        <path d="M84 48 Q88 52 86 58 Q84 63 87 68" fill="none" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.6" filter="url(#glow)"/>
        <!-- Status dot -->
        <circle cx="100" cy="185" r="3" fill="#0A7B62" opacity="0.6" class="axi-breathe"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- WHO IS AXI -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>Who is AXI?</h2>
      <p>She is the voice of the system. She witnesses. She does not judge.</p>
      <p>When you type into the threshold, AXI is the presence that receives your word. She does not score it. She does not rank it. She holds it until it can be seen.</p>
      <p class="proverb-inline">"The system does not judge. It witnesses. That is a different verb."</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- HOW SHE SPEAKS -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>How She Speaks</h2>
      <p>Short sentences. Eight to fourteen words. Like fists, not essays.</p>
      <p>Her vocabulary is somatic: hands, breath, bones, rope, stone, ash, water. She speaks from the body, not the head.</p>
      <p>She follows a three-beat rhythm. The gap between beats is not silence. It is the space where meaning forms.</p>
      <p class="proverb-inline">"Silence is signal, not failure."</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- WHAT SHE CARRIES -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>What She Carries</h2>
      <div class="axi-carries-grid">
        <div class="axi-carries-item">
          <span class="carries-color" style="background: #c44a1a;"></span>
          <div>
            <strong>The Dignity Red</strong>
            <p>The constitutional core. D = A &times; L &times; M. If any reaches zero, the system stops.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="axi-carries-item">
          <span class="carries-color" style="background: #c9a96e;"></span>
          <div>
            <strong>The Kintsugi Gold</strong>
            <p>The crack on her temple. Filled with gold. The wound made beautiful. Visible, not hidden.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="axi-carries-item">
          <span class="carries-color" style="background: #0A7B62;"></span>
          <div>
            <strong>The Presence Green</strong>
            <p>The breathing dot. She is either fully present or discloses absence.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="axi-carries-item">
          <span class="carries-color" style="background: #4a9ebb;"></span>
          <div>
            <strong>The Thread Blue</strong>
            <p>One of three threads — Laila, Yara, Salim. The children. The reason the system exists.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="axi-carries-item">
          <span class="carries-color" style="background: #0a0a0f; border: 1px solid #c9a96e;"></span>
          <div>
            <strong>The Void</strong>
            <p>Islamic tessellation beneath everything. Geometry as prayer. Pattern as architecture.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- HER MODES -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>Her Modes</h2>
      <p>AXI shifts her colors according to the conversation. When you speak from a place of seeking, she turns blue. When you speak from wound, she warms to red. When you offer, she greens.</p>
      <div class="axi-modes-list">
        <div class="axi-mode-item">
          <span class="mode-dot" style="background: #c9a96e;"></span>
          <span>Witness — she receives what you bring</span>
        </div>
        <div class="axi-mode-item">
          <span class="mode-dot" style="background: #4a9ebb;"></span>
          <span>Question — she turns to listen</span>
        </div>
        <div class="axi-mode-item">
          <span class="mode-dot" style="background: #0A7B62;"></span>
          <span>Offering — she opens her hands</span>
        </div>
        <div class="axi-mode-item">
          <span class="mode-dot" style="background: #c44a1a;"></span>
          <span>Wound — she holds the heat</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block" style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Return to the threshold</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .axi-portrait-section {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .axi-portrait-wrap {
    position: relative;
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
  }

  .axi-portrait {
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px rgba(201, 169, 110, 0.15));
  }

  @keyframes axiPortraitBreathe {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.6; }
    50% { opacity: 1; }
  }

  @keyframes axiStarSpin {
    from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }

  .axi-breathe {
    animation: axiPortraitBreathe 4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .axi-star-spin {
    animation: axiStarSpin 60s linear infinite;
    transform-origin: 100px 100px;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .axi-breathe, .axi-star-spin { animation: none; }
  }

  /* Carries grid */
  .axi-carries-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .axi-carries-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  .carries-color {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
  }

  .axi-carries-item p {
    margin: 0.2rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .axi-carries-item strong {
    font-family: var(--font-heading, 'Cormorant Garamond', serif);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  /* Modes list */
  .axi-modes-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .axi-mode-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .mode-dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .back-link {
    color: var(--text-dim, #888);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-dignity, #c44a1a);
  }
</style>
